  "description": "WinterForge is a high-performance, reflection-powered serialization and behavior execution framework for .NET. \nWinterForge goes beyond standard ideas of serializers. Supporting type inheritence, circle references, and differed references out of the box.\nIt also allows accessing fields of already deserialzied objects, static classes. and calling methods on both!",
